Assets / Inhalte

All pictures (characters, pets, houses, city, icons), sounds and the music in
this project are generated by the code in this repository (inline SVG and the
Web Audio API) and were made for this project. No third-party images, fonts,
sound files, music or brand assets are included. The game only names system
fonts; no font files are shipped. These assets are covered by the MIT License
above.

Alle Bilder, Töne und die Musik werden vom Code in diesem Projekt selbst
erzeugt (SVG und Web Audio). Es gibt keine fremden Bilder, Schriften, Töne,
Musik oder Marken.
